---
import MakerLayout from '../../layouts/MakerLayout.astro';
import demand from '../../data/demand/demand.json';
import seoOpportunities from '../../data/seo/seo-opportunities.json';

const activeOpportunities = Array.isArray(seoOpportunities)
  ? seoOpportunities.filter(item => item.evidence?.fallback !== true)
  : [];
const trendCount = Array.isArray(demand?.opportunities)
  ? demand.opportunities.length
  : 0;
---
<MakerLayout title="Useful Generator Ideas — PARADOX Makers" description="Demand-driven use cases for PARADOX Makers free generators, selected from aggregate public trend signals.">
  <main class="maker-main">
    <section class="maker-hero compact-hero">
      <div>
        <div class="maker-kicker">USE CASE LIBRARY</div>
        <h1>Search demand,<br/><em>turned into tools.</em></h1>
        <p>These pages connect current public attention signals to real generator jobs. Every page points to a working free browser tool rather than a keyword-only article.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maker-proof">
        <div class="proof-tile"><strong>{activeOpportunities.length} ACTIVE</strong><span>Demand-selected use cases available in this build.</span></div>
        <div class="proof-tile"><strong>{trendCount} SIGNALS</strong><span>Global demand opportunities collected for this refresh.</span></div>
        <div class="proof-tile"><strong>NO ACCOUNT</strong><span>Visitors can use every core generator directly.</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="maker-section">
      <div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">CURRENT OPPORTUNITIES</div><h2>Useful pages only.</h2></div><p>Automatic selection is deliberately capped. A trend is not enough by itself; PARADOX needs a matching tool that can solve a concrete job.</p></div>
      <div class="maker-tools">
        {activeOpportunities.map((item, index) => <a class="maker-card" href={`/use-cases/${item.slug}/`}><div><div class="maker-card-top"><div class="maker-icon">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h2>{item.title}</h2><p>{item.description}</p></div><div class="maker-open">Open use case →</div></a>)}
      </div>
      {activeOpportunities.length === 0 && <article class="maker-why"><p>No publishable use-case pages are available in this build. The next demand refresh will repopulate this library when a public signal matches a real tool.</p></article>}
    </section>
    <section class="maker-section">
      <article class="maker-why"><div class="maker-label">TRANSPARENCY</div><h2>Automation with a brake.</h2><p>PARADOX combines aggregate public trend signals with a fixed set of real tools. It does not publish thousands of cloned keyword pages, scrape private search histories, or claim guaranteed rankings.</p><p><a href="/trending/">See the global demand radar →</a></p></article>
    </section>
  </main>
</MakerLayout>
